Earth Elemental
    Events
        Unit - A unit Begins channeling an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ELEMENTAL_Channel_EarthElemental 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in ElementalGroupNazgrek and do (Unit - Kill (Picked unit))
                Wait 3.00 seconds
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of Nazgrek)
                Unit - Create 1 Earth Elemental for Player 1 (Red) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Set VariableSet SummonElemental_UnitType = (Unit-type of (Last created unit))
                Set VariableSet SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit = (Last created unit)
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to ElementalGroupNazgrek
                -------- -------------------------------- --------
                Unit - Change ownership of (Last created unit) to Player 19 (Mint) and Retain color
                -------- Enable Follow Loop --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Summon Elemental Follow <gen> is on) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Trigger - Turn on Summon Elemental Follow <gen>
                    Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
            Then - Actions
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in ElementalGroupZulkis and do (Unit - Kill (Picked unit))
                Wait 3.00 seconds
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of Zulkis)
                Unit - Create 1 Earth Elemental for Player 1 (Red) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Set VariableSet SummonElemental_UnitType = (Unit-type of (Last created unit))
                Set VariableSet SummonElemental_ZulkisUnit = (Last created unit)
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to ElementalGroupZulkis
                -------- -------------------------------- --------
                Unit - Change ownership of (Last created unit) to Player 19 (Mint) and Retain color
                -------- Enable Follow Loop --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Summon Elemental Follow <gen> is on) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Trigger - Turn on Summon Elemental Follow <gen>
                    Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
